# Build context = repo root. Keep it small and never leak host artifacts.

# --- version control / editor / agent tooling ---
.git
.gitignore
.claude
**/.DS_Store

# --- dependencies & build output (reinstalled / rebuilt inside the image) ---
# Excluding node_modules is critical: it stops host (macOS) binaries from being
# copied over the linux deps installed in the image, and lets `COPY . .` in the
# build stage overlay source without clobbering installed node_modules.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.pnpm-store

# --- local dev state / Workflow local-world durable data ---
**/.workflow-data

# --- secrets / local env (build needs none) ---
**/.env
**/.env.*

# --- the Python extraction worker is a separate Railway service ---
services

# --- tests / coverage / docs not needed in the image ---
**/coverage
**/.vitest
README.md

